      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CATCH A CUTIE (1) produced a modest effort most recently when fifth at Traralgon over 350m behind Woodside Wombat (20.62) in a Grade 5. Was in the money the start prior. Comes through a solid form race last start. Better than the latest effort and deserves another chance. ANCONA (7) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by 9 lengths at Warragul in a handy 23.17 beating Justified Jim. Winner at his latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. One of the prime contenders. GREEN FROG CAFE (2) was a winner (25.03) at this track two back but out of the placings last time when 7th there. Solid record here at the distance winning five races. Strong form has emerged from his last run. Can do much better this time. CHEER DOWN (8) justified the favourite's tag last time - sure to feature again.",
